{# The current user's avatar — used wherever their identity is shown
   (mobile header, mobile offcanvas card, desktop bar). Always wrapped in
   an <a href="/account"> at the call site: both the avatar and the
   display name next to it link to "Mon compte", never to the
   notification centre — the unread-notifications indication lives
   entirely in partials/notification_dropdown.html.twig instead, a
   separate element.

   The drawing itself is the shared component (person_avatar(),
   Core\View\PersonAvatar): this person's own photo when they have set
   one on "Mon compte", their initials otherwise — the same circle the
   menu draws for a member and a discussion group draws for an author.
   This partial stays as the place that knows WHICH person and at what
   size, so the three call sites keep passing nothing but a size.

   `font_size` is still accepted and ignored: the component derives it
   from the diameter, so the two can never disagree. #}
{{ person_avatar(
    current_user_avatar_name|default(current_user_display_name|default('')),
    { account_id: current_user_account_id|default(0), size: size|default(40) }
) }}
